+  - id: G6
+    principle: "A play writes only inside its own declared write scope; a play's scope is widened on purpose, in that play."
+    source: "ontology.md head ('Who writes') and standards/rules/direct-model-write.md (base ref)"
+  - id: G7
+    principle: "The ontology format: kinds with Who reads it, Layer, In the tracker as, Lives at, Properties, Relationships, Rules, States, Example; a Log line for each version."
+    source: "standards/templates/product-ontology.md (base ref)"
+  - id: G8
+    principle: "Voice rule covers replies to the user, not artifact files; the ontology must still be plain words with no real names."
+    source: "standards/rules/user-facing-voice.md 'Scope' (base ref)"
